python-pip (25.2+dfsg-1deepin1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Security fix for CVE-2025-8869, CVE-2026-1703:
    - Add patch for CVE-2025-8869: Fix path traversal vulnerability in tar
      archive extraction via symbolic links. (Closes: #1116336)
    - Add patch for CVE-2026-1703: Fix path traversal vulnerability in wheel
      archive extraction by using os.path.commonpath() instead of
      os.path.commonprefix(). (Closes: #1126875)
  * Fix build error:
    - Add fix-sphinx-inline-tabs.patch to disable sphinx_inline_tabs extension
      which causes KeyError: 'backrefs' during documentation build.

